   {
    "id": "03-recommend",
    "title": "第三问：快照上的 recommend(user_id, k)",
    "label": "第三问",
    "subtitle": "快照上的 recommend(user_id, k)",
    "notesHtml": "<h1>第三问：快照上的 recommend(user_id, k)</h1>\n<h2>面试官给的骨架</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-python\">class Snapshot:\n    def recommend(self, user_id: str, k: int) -&gt; list[str]: ...\n        # 2-hop 推荐：数 user_id 关注的人里有几个关注了每个候选人；\n        # 剔除 user_id 自己和已关注的人；按数量从多到少取前 k</code></pre>\n<h2>思路</h2>\n<p><strong>开口先定的口径。</strong></p>\n<ol><li>候选是\"user_id 关注的人关注的人\"，两层，不往第三层走。</li><li>剔除 user_id 自己和 user_id 已关注的人。这决定了第一层要整体存着，内层循环每次遇到都查一次。</li><li>并列按名字排，只为结果确定。这个版本没有时间戳，没有\"最近\"可用；面试里说\"并列任意\"也行。</li><li>k 为 0 返回空，k 超过候选数返回全部。</li></ol>\n<p><strong>三步。</strong> 取 first_hop = _following[user_id]。对 first_hop 里每个 b，遍历 _following[b] 里每个 c：c 等于 user_id 或 c 在 first_hop 里就跳过，否则 count[c] 加一。按 (-count, 名字) 排序，切前 k。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么剔除写在内层循环。</strong> 自己和已关注的人可能被多个中间人指到。只在第一次遇到时判断，第二次遇到还是会计数。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么 _following[b] 不用 get。</strong> b 来自 first_hop，first_hop 是表里的值，而 follow 写入前检查过 followee 存在，所以 b 一定是表里的键。用方括号是在说明你知道这个保证。</p>\n<p><strong>用题面例子走一遍。</strong> A 关注 B、C；B 关注 D、E；C 关注 D、F。</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>步骤</th><th>看谁的那一行</th><th>遇到谁</th><th>剔除</th><th>count</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>first_hop = {B, C}</td><td></td><td></td><td>空</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>B:{D, E}</td><td>D、E</td><td>无</td><td>D:1 E:1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>C:{D, F}</td><td>D、F</td><td>无</td><td>D:2 E:1 F:1</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>排序</td><td></td><td></td><td>D、E、F</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>recommend(A, 2) 切前 2 是 [D, E]。</p>\n<p>再加两条边看剔除：B 关注 A，C 关注 B。看 B 那行多出 A，是自己，跳过。看 C 那行多出 B，在 first_hop 里，跳过。结果不变。</p>\n<p><strong>复杂度。</strong> 计数 F × G，F 是第一层人数，G 是每个中间人的关注数。排序 C log C，C 是候选数。k 小、C 大时换成大小为 k 的堆，C log k；Python 里 heapq.nsmallest(k, count, key=...) 或 Counter.most_common(k)。内存 O(C)。</p>\n<h2>常见疑问</h2>\n<h3>和版本一的推荐差在哪</h3>\n<p>算法一样。版本一每取一层都要按 t 过滤，并列按最近的边排。这个版本表里只有当前状态，直接取行，没有时间可比，并列按名字或任意。</p>\n<h3>大 V 中间人怎么办</h3>\n<p>A 关注了一个关注一百万人的账号，第二层就要扫一百万。答法和版本一相同：每个中间人只取前 N 个，或离线算好存起来，或抽样。</p>\n<h3>为什么不用反向表</h3>\n<p>推荐只用\"谁关注了谁\"的正向方向：A 关注的人，他们关注的人。反向表回答\"谁关注了 X\"，这里用不上。有一种变体推荐\"关注你的人也关注的人\"，那才用反向表。</p>",
    "files": [
     {
      "name": "solution.py",
      "content": "class SocialNetwork:\n    def __init__(self):\n        # 用户 -> 他关注的人的集合。\n        # 用 set 是因为\"是否已关注\"要常数时间判断，而且往 set 里加已有元素不会变，\n        # \"重复关注不做任何事\"这条规则就不用额外写判断。\n        self._following = {}\n\n    def add_user(self, user_id: str) -> None:\n        if user_id in self._following:\n            raise ValueError(f\"user already exists: {user_id}\")\n        self._following[user_id] = set()\n\n    def follow(self, follower: str, followee: str) -> None:\n        # 用户不存在是调用方的错误，报错而不是吞掉，否则数据会悄悄变脏。\n        if follower not in self._following:\n            raise ValueError(f\"unknown user: {follower}\")\n        if followee not in self._following:\n            raise ValueError(f\"unknown user: {followee}\")\n        if follower == followee:\n            return  # 自己关注自己无害，不记录也不报错\n        self._following[follower].add(followee)\n\n    def create_snapshot(self) -> \"Snapshot\":\n        return Snapshot(self._following)\n\n\nclass Snapshot:\n    def __init__(self, following):\n        # 每个用户的集合都用 frozenset 新建一份，而不是引用主表里的那个 set。\n        # 只复制外层表的话，内层集合和主表共用同一个对象，之后 follow 往主表加人，快照也跟着变。\n        # frozenset 同时保证快照自己也改不了。\n        self._following = {user: frozenset(f) for user, f in following.items()}\n        # 反向表：被关注者 -> 关注他的人。正向表只能按关注者查，\"谁关注了 X\"要扫全表。\n        # 快照建好后不再变，所以在这里建一次，之后每次 get_followers 只花粉丝数的时间。\n        followers = {user: set() for user in following}\n        for user, f in following.items():\n            for followee in f:\n                followers[followee].add(user)\n        self._followers = {user: frozenset(f) for user, f in followers.items()}\n\n    def is_following(self, follower: str, followee: str) -> bool:\n        # 快照里没有这个用户（快照之后才加的）当作没关注任何人，返回 False 不报错。\n        return followee in self._following.get(follower, frozenset())\n\n    def get_following(self, user_id: str) -> list:\n        # 集合没有顺序，排序后返回，结果确定、好测。不要求顺序可以去掉 sorted。\n        return sorted(self._following.get(user_id, frozenset()))\n\n    def get_followers(self, user_id: str) -> list:\n        return sorted(self._followers.get(user_id, frozenset()))\n\n    def recommend(self, user_id: str, k: int) -> list:\n        \"\"\"给 user_id 推荐\"他关注的人也在关注的人\"，按中间人数从多到少取前 k 个。\"\"\"\n        first_hop = self._following.get(user_id, frozenset())  # 第一层整体先拿到，剔除\"已关注\"时要查它\n        count = {}                                             # 候选人 -> 中间人数\n        for b in first_hop:\n            for c in self._following[b]:                       # b 一定在表里：follow 时检查过他存在\n                if c == user_id or c in first_hop:\n                    continue                                   # 自己、已关注的，不推荐\n                count[c] = count.get(c, 0) + 1\n        ranked = sorted(count, key=lambda c: (-count[c], c))   # 中间人数多的在前，并列按名字只为结果确定\n        return ranked[:k]\n"
     },
     {
      "name": "tests.py",
      "content": "from solution import SocialNetwork\n\n\ndef _raises_value_error(fn):\n    try:\n        fn()\n    except ValueError:\n        return True\n    return False\n\n\ndef _network(*users):\n    net = SocialNetwork()\n    for u in users:\n        net.add_user(u)\n    return net\n\n\ndef test_add_user_duplicate_raises():\n    net = _network(\"A\")\n    assert _raises_value_error(lambda: net.add_user(\"A\"))   # 已存在的用户再加，报错\n\n\ndef test_follow_unknown_user_raises():\n    net = _network(\"A\")\n    assert _raises_value_error(lambda: net.follow(\"A\", \"B\"))  # 被关注者不存在\n    assert _raises_value_error(lambda: net.follow(\"B\", \"A\"))  # 关注者不存在\n\n\ndef test_follow_is_directional():\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    s = net.create_snapshot()\n    assert s.is_following(\"A\", \"B\") is True\n    assert s.is_following(\"B\", \"A\") is False                  # 关注是单向的\n\n\ndef test_self_follow_and_duplicate_follow_are_noops():\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"A\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    assert net._following[\"A\"] == {\"B\"}                       # 自己不在集合里，B 只有一份\n    s = net.create_snapshot()\n    assert s.is_following(\"A\", \"A\") is False\n\n\ndef test_snapshot_ignores_later_follow():\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    s1 = net.create_snapshot()\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"C\")\n    assert s1.is_following(\"A\", \"B\") is True                  # 快照前的关注，看得到\n    assert s1.is_following(\"A\", \"C\") is False                 # 快照后的关注，看不到\n\n\ndef test_two_snapshots_are_independent():\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    s1 = net.create_snapshot()\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"C\")\n    s2 = net.create_snapshot()\n    assert s1.is_following(\"A\", \"C\") is False\n    assert s2.is_following(\"A\", \"C\") is True                  # 后一个快照包含新关注\n    assert s2.is_following(\"A\", \"B\") is True                  # 也包含旧关注\n\n\ndef test_snapshot_ignores_later_add_user():\n    net = _network(\"A\")\n    s = net.create_snapshot()\n    net.add_user(\"D\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"D\")\n    assert s.is_following(\"A\", \"D\") is False                  # D 是快照后加的\n    assert s.is_following(\"D\", \"A\") is False                  # 不存在的用户当作没关注任何人\n\n\ndef test_empty_network_snapshot():\n    s = SocialNetwork().create_snapshot()\n    assert s.is_following(\"A\", \"B\") is False\n\n\ndef _example_snapshot():\n    # A 关注 B、C；B 关注 C。反向表应为 A:{} B:{A} C:{A, B}\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"C\")\n    net.follow(\"B\", \"C\")\n    return net, net.create_snapshot()\n\n\ndef test_get_following():\n    _, s = _example_snapshot()\n    assert s.get_following(\"A\") == [\"B\", \"C\"]                 # 排序后返回\n    assert s.get_following(\"B\") == [\"C\"]\n    assert s.get_following(\"C\") == []                         # 没关注任何人\n\n\ndef test_get_followers():\n    _, s = _example_snapshot()\n    assert s.get_followers(\"C\") == [\"A\", \"B\"]                 # 两个人关注 C\n    assert s.get_followers(\"B\") == [\"A\"]\n    assert s.get_followers(\"A\") == []                         # 没人关注 A\n\n\ndef test_lists_for_unknown_user_are_empty():\n    _, s = _example_snapshot()\n    assert s.get_following(\"Z\") == []\n    assert s.get_followers(\"Z\") == []\n\n\ndef test_following_and_followers_are_consistent():\n    _, s = _example_snapshot()\n    for user in (\"A\", \"B\", \"C\"):\n        for followee in s.get_following(user):\n            assert user in s.get_followers(followee)          # 正向表里有的，反向表里一定有\n\n\ndef test_lists_ignore_later_follow():\n    net, s = _example_snapshot()\n    net.follow(\"C\", \"A\")\n    assert s.get_followers(\"A\") == []                         # 快照后的关注不进反向表\n    assert s.get_following(\"C\") == []                         # 也不进正向表\n    assert net.create_snapshot().get_followers(\"A\") == [\"C\"]  # 新快照才有\n\n\ndef _recommend_snapshot():\n    # 题面例子：A 关注 B、C；B 关注 D、E；C 关注 D、F\n    net = _network(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\", \"F\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"B\")\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"C\")\n    net.follow(\"B\", \"D\")\n    net.follow(\"B\", \"E\")\n    net.follow(\"C\", \"D\")\n    net.follow(\"C\", \"F\")\n    return net\n\n\ndef test_recommend_ranks_by_intermediary_count():\n    s = _recommend_snapshot().create_snapshot()\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 2) == [\"D\", \"E\"]                  # D 有 B、C 两个中间人排第一；E、F 并列按名字\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 3) == [\"D\", \"E\", \"F\"]\n\n\ndef test_recommend_excludes_self_and_already_followed():\n    net = _recommend_snapshot()\n    net.follow(\"B\", \"A\")                                      # B 回关 A，第二层会出现 A 自己\n    net.follow(\"C\", \"B\")                                      # C 关注 B，第二层会出现 A 已关注的 B\n    s = net.create_snapshot()\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 10) == [\"D\", \"E\", \"F\"]            # A 和 B 都不在名单里\n\n\ndef test_recommend_k_bounds():\n    s = _recommend_snapshot().create_snapshot()\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 0) == []                          # k 为 0 返回空\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 1) == [\"D\"]\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 100) == [\"D\", \"E\", \"F\"]           # k 超过候选数返回全部\n\n\ndef test_recommend_without_followees_or_unknown_user():\n    s = _recommend_snapshot().create_snapshot()\n    assert s.recommend(\"D\", 5) == []                          # D 没关注任何人，没有第一层\n    assert s.recommend(\"Z\", 5) == []                          # 不存在的用户\n\n\ndef test_recommend_ignores_later_follow():\n    net = _recommend_snapshot()\n    s = net.create_snapshot()\n    net.follow(\"A\", \"D\")                                      # 快照后 A 直接关注了 D\n    assert s.recommend(\"A\", 1) == [\"D\"]                       # 旧快照仍推荐 D\n    assert net.create_snapshot().recommend(\"A\", 1) == [\"E\"]   # 新快照里 D 已关注，不再推荐\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    tests = [\n        test_add_user_duplicate_raises,\n        test_follow_unknown_user_raises,\n        test_follow_is_directional,\n        test_self_follow_and_duplicate_follow_are_noops,\n        test_snapshot_ignores_later_follow,\n        test_two_snapshots_are_independent,\n        test_snapshot_ignores_later_add_user,\n        test_empty_network_snapshot,\n        test_get_following,\n        test_get_followers,\n        test_lists_for_unknown_user_are_empty,\n        test_following_and_followers_are_consistent,\n        test_lists_ignore_later_follow,\n        test_recommend_ranks_by_intermediary_count,\n        test_recommend_excludes_self_and_already_followed,\n        test_recommend_k_bounds,\n        test_recommend_without_followees_or_unknown_user,\n        test_recommend_ignores_later_follow,\n    ]\n    for t in tests:\n        t()\n    print(f\"all {len(tests)} passed\")\n"
     }
    ],
    "testResult": {
     "ok": true,
     "output": "all 18 passed"
    }
   }
